<!--Post: 12633--><!--Time: 1112643262-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12633"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 04, 2005 - 12:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you, very much, my friend. And in this blog entry - <a href="http://www.planethuff.com/darkside/archives/000643.html">The Hope Only of Empty Men</a> at my &#39;true crime&#39; blog, The Dark Side, you, Nightdriver, play a very important role. I <b>try</b> to rarely make it a point to ask others here to read my blog, but this is an entry I&#39;d really like some feedback about. You can find out how to give me that feedback if you look at the blog.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
