</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dahlia<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 04, 2005 - 11:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If I may just say so, Mr. Huff, you&#39;re a very fine writer. And yes, IMVHO, you could definitely be onto something.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
